WEBVTT

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:38.660
The task of this mission
is to get a special seasoning recipe.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:42.870
The two people in the picture
used to run a chain noodle shop together.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.250
One was responsible
for the front management,

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.580
the other for the backstage kitchen.

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:49.500
They have been partners
for over ten years, and been tacit.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:55.120
So, the secret recipe of the famous
noodle has been kept by her.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:58.080
Does she keep it a secret even from you?

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.830
I was too naive.

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:03.910
I never thought that one day she would
betray me and make a fresh start.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:07.370
That's why she is so anxious
to get back the secret recipe.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:09.660
Well, any questions?

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:11.910
No, the explanation was all-sided.

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:14.120
Lu Guang, do you have any questions?

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:17.660
What are the names of them?

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:18.830
Yu Xia.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:20.000
Lin Zhen.

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:41.620
There are lots of photos, but few clues.

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:44.290
Without many chances,
we can only try one step at a time.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:53.040
I don't understand, they've been
partners for so many years,

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:55.160
why did they break off their friendship?

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:56.910
What a pity it is!

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.870
Just do the job

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:02.410
instead of caring about the whole story.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:05.580
By the way,

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.910
if we disagree with each other one day,

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:09.830
shall we break up, too?

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:18.450
If you dare to play politics
behind my back.

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:19.830
Almost time.

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:27.080
I'll scratch your handsome face!

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.370
Childish!

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.330
You stone, me paper,

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.540
you lose, game over.

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:42.660
You are more childish than me!

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:44.830
Gear up.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:48.910
Dive.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.540
Lin Zhen, stay there,

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:57.790
let me see if the new night mode is clear.

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.950
We've worked all day.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:03.330
After the whole busy day,
don't you feel tired?

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:05.160
Today is the first day of opening,

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.330
it's like the first night
of our honeymoon.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:10.450
We will take a picture at this place
and this time every year.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:14.040
Review the previous photos and
look for any clues, then move on!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.660
Yu Xia, don't set anything.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.790
Just take the photo.

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:25.160
There's a lot of work left to do!

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.700
Everything is done finally!

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:35.290
I think...

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.250
...even getting married
wouldn't be so tiring.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.200
If it is more tiring than this,

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:42.000
I won't get married.

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:45.870
You just said today is our honeymoon.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.290
Shall we now...

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:53.040
I'm joking with you.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:55.000
What are you doing now?

00:04:56.160 --> 00:05:00.250
You used to sleep with me after
we watched horror flicks in the dorm.

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:04.200
They used to be roommates in college.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.620
Stop teasing you.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.450
We served customers all day.

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:11.790
It's time to serve ourselves.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.410
I'll make noodles.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.200
I thought you were tired?

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:18.790
What are you waiting for?
Into the kitchen.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:29.540
Is there really a secret recipe?

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:32.200
It's just a pot of stew.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:33.500
Coming soon.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.580
Right there.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.620
Lin Zhen, what are you taking?

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:49.790
Like you don't know.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:51.700
Playing dumb?

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.290
Scheming girl!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:56.580
--Er...
--Anybody home? Here comes the goods!

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.700
Anyone home?

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:00.040
Parking is not allowed here,
open the door!

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:00.700
What is it?

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:03.410
Hey! I'll go if nobody answer me.

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:05.870
What are you doing? Go get the door.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:06.870
Listen to her.

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:10.370
If the goods aren't received,
everything will change after that.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:16.080
Nobody home really?
Okay, I'm leaving!

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:18.290
Hurry up!

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:20.790
I'm coming!

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:31.200
So why'd you keep me waiting?

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.750
Oh, it's a female boss!

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:37.580
It's much better for you
to find a good guy to get married.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.450
Running a shop?
Don't you want an easier life?

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:41.580
What's wrong with women?

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:45.080
We have hands, feet, and brains.
You men are shameless and inconstant.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:47.580
If you're really a man,
move all these inside for me!

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:48.700
Aren't I right?

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.700
Yes...

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.830
All the materials have been used up.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:02.580
I've tried my best. Enjoy it.

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:04.830
What about you?

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:10.000
My happiness is enjoying the expression
on your face while you are eating noodles.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.700
She doesn't look so bad.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.500
Don't jump to judgment!

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.040
People can change.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:19.790
As old rules, together!

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.040
I still remember our time in
the university, ingredients were lacking.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.410
We never have the chance to chose.

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:27.540
Just like this,
we put everything in the pot.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:32.660
How about we make this bowl of noodles
a symbol of our shop?

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:35.000
Nice! It will be named...

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:37.290
Bowl of the Female Dormitory!

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:43.870
Wow, what does she add
into the noodle soup?

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:47.080
A refreshing fragrance
and sweet in the mouth.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:50.790
Lu Guang, it's a pity you can't taste it!

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:53.660
Eh, I don't care.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:00.120
Hey, idiot. I told you
not to add anything!

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:02.540
This is out my control!

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:20.750
We can't find anything in this picture.

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:26.910
Ready for another one.

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:28.870
How do you feel about your
Bowl of the Female Dormitory

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:29.830
becoming famous overnight?

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:32.330
In fact, I don't really
give it lots of thought.

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:34.540
Cooking is my personal interest,

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:38.370
and I believe that good memories
can be kept in the meals.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.700
Stop, stop, stop.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:42.790
Boss, if you want to take pictures,
turn off the flash, okay?

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.790
It will affect the camera effect.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.660
I'm sorry, you just keep going.

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:51.660
After that, when the
reporters film her cooking,

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:53.830
you can look for the clues of the recipe.

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:56.250
Chef, let's add a live cooking video.

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:58.870
The broadcast will be even better.

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:01.540
Hey, reporter friends.
Be careful in the kitchen.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.580
Please, please, everybody!

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.080
That's all for today,

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:07.500
it's not convenient
to disclose any further steps.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.540
Oh, so stingy!

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:11.620
We want to have an exclusive story.

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:14.500
Failed again.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.580
Keep on trying!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:19.790
We strive to put all purchase lists
into the system tonight.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.700
In the future,
with the intelligent management,

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:24.410
you don't have to check
the suppliers every time.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.580
They will deliver on time.

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:32.080
Yu Xia,

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:33.700
how long haven't you been home?

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:34.870
Eh...

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:37.790
Years maybe, I can't remember.

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:39.790
I can't go home because of the business.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.040
Is that all?

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.500
Yes, confirmed.

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:54.200
Everything on these lists is

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:56.250
available on the market.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.450
Damn it! There is still no progress!

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:09.620
Yu Xia!

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:12.290
Here come the designs for
the new logo. Can you choose?

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.750
Okay, I'm coming!

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:20.160
Nothing again...

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.870
Boss, these are new tastes.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:24.910
We tried many regional
flavors that are chosen

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:26.450
from different places around the country.

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:39.370
Something tasty?

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:43.500
If the case failed, we will go hungry.

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.830
Make do with it now.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.910
Boss, just take a break.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:53.450
It's harmful to eat
so many noodles one time!

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:57.330
No, since we want to
open national chain shop,

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:59.040
we must expand our product lines.

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:00.370
Next!

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.620
Why noodles again?

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:04.500
I'm gonna puke!

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:06.500
Different taste, try again.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:09.040
I ate more than ten bowls
in the last picture,

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:12.250
no noodles anymore in my future life!

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:14.410
I'm so sorry, Miss Yu,

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:17.250
we are trying our best
to look for the clues.

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:18.790
It's been a long time.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:21.910
We don't know where
she's hiding and preparing.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:24.700
If there is such a difficult case
in the future again,

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:27.000
we must ask Qiao for overtime pay!

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:30.200
Once she opens the shop
with the signature noodles,

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:32.830
the chain brand that
I worked hard to build

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.790
will be destroyed!

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:39.580
You have been looking at
the last photo for quite a long time.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:40.910
You find anything?

00:11:41.870 --> 00:11:45.080
No, there is no chance in this photo.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:46.160
Give it up.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:52.540
Not seeing hope
doesn't mean there is no hope.

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:53.580
Come on.

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:04.040
We said that we would
take one photo each year,

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:07.700
but the second one is
after more than ten years.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:12.700
Don't let it be the last one, okay?

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:18.080
This photo was taken by Lin Zhen!

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:20.000
Yes, but unfortunately,

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:24.160
there are no useful clues in 12 hours.

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:26.120
Lin Zhen...

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:28.080
Can you stay?

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.910
You got intelligent management,

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:33.160
a precise cooking line,

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:35.160
and perfect commercial packing.

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:41.620
It's really not the place for a person
like me who cooks with passion.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:48.580
But why don't you try to adapt, to change,

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.830
to achieve a greater dream?

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:55.750
The noodle shop over ten years ago

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.910
is my greatest dream.

00:12:57.910 --> 00:13:01.000
But you have seen, our business
is getting better and better,

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:03.580
more and more customers need our service.

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:05.250
They're all for you.

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:07.830
It's you who makes them feel happy!

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:12.370
I'm sorry!

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.830
I don't have enough happiness

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.830
to share with all the people.

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:19.620
So we need more money, a bigger group,

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:21.620
and even more better resources to help us!

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:24.450
No, it's only for you.

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.160
In order to expand the influence,

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:32.160
such a disgusting brand name can be used.

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:35.620
This shop no longer belongs to me.

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:39.700
Leave the recipe to...

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:44.540
Ah, I don't know either.

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:45.580
Idiot.

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:46.790
Say the lines!

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.080
I have nothing to say.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:51.160
This is our common property,
no one has the right to own it!

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.870
I can seek a lawyer and sue you!

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:54.950
Suit yourself!

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:58.950
She is the one who totally changed.

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:01.370
Nothing is absolute, just walk away.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:02.540
Excuse me.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:11.660
Where are you going?

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:16.500
Back to the beginning.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.120
I'll restart.

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:41.870
How is it going?

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:45.160
Is there any information about the recipe?

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:49.250
Ah, I seek it all over,
but nothing useful.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.950
Do we have any other chance?

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.660
None.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:15:00.000
She's crying all night at home,
not going anywhere.

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.540
Yo.

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.750
The details of your performance
were quite in place this time.

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.580
I used to know you were cold and negative,

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:46.160
I didn't expect that
you could be so weird now.

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:48.330
You're such a disgusting man!

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:51.080
Let it out.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:54.250
I've been driving for so many years
and have seen so many people.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:59.080
Ladies who talk to themselves after
arguing with the husband just like you.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.330
Don't worry about it.

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:03.160
It just goes in one ear and out the other.

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.200
Xiang Zhuang...

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:14.200
Hey, Xiang Zhuang is a good place!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:18.750
Not so big, but there are lots of trees,
water, and beautiful scenery.

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:22.120
There's also a plant
called fragrant flower,

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:25.620
with beautiful blossoms
and a pleasant smell.

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.620
Local people dry and grind it into powder

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:30.660
to use as seasoning.

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:35.410
That is to say, Lin Zhen often
goes to Xiang Zhuang for...

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:36.870
...stocking?

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:42.250
Your assertion should be right!

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:44.040
And because it's a folk recipe,

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:46.700
few people know that.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.910
What Lin Zhen puts in the soup should be

00:16:48.910 --> 00:16:51.370
the powder of fragrant flowers.

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:54.200
It only grows in Xiang Zhuang,
and only in small quantity.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:59.410
You mean... Xiang Zhuang fragrant flowers?

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.000
Yeah, of course.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:03.700
It's just what we infer from the clues.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:07.200
In fact, maybe you need to
ask someone to sample it.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:09.870
That's right.

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:12.500
Yes, that's it...

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:17.330
I finally find it.

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.290
Mission complete!

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:35.120
Believe it or not,
I was afraid of eating that before.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:37.200
But now that I can't eat it...

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.370
I even miss the taste.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.580
It's a pity you never had the chance,

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.910
and you will never know how it feels.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.080
Get away!

00:17:51.620 --> 00:17:53.370
Why'd we miss this one here?

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:58.870
This is the screen saver of
Lin Zhen's mobile phone!

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:01.580
That would've been taken in their dorm.

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:04.580
When Qiao Lin comes here,
tell her to return it.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:09.660
What's your problem? Fussy idiot.

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:12.580
Noodles, noodles, noodles!

00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:15.330
Can I go to eat that for the last time?

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:16.500
No!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:19.790
How can you enter the client's photo
for such naive reasons?

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:22.450
Oh, come on, one last time.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.700
Please!

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.250
No way!

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:30.540
You!

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:38.870
You are smart, Lin Zhen!

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:40.950
Noodles in the rice cooker...

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:42.750
Great! Really great!

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:44.870
You're an absolutely brilliant cook!

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.950
Maybe it's a good choice for us to open

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:48.870
a small noodle shop
nearby after graduation.

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:50.370
Hey, Lu Guang.

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:52.580
What should I say?

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.120
There are take-outs
everywhere in the future.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.910
That will never do.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.200
We should learn about
intelligent management,

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:03.580
and we should get an APP, too.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.870
Oh? APP?

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.450
What is APP?

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:10.200
No, no, no, opening a shop
together is also great!

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:13.410
No, no, no, opening a shop
together is also great!

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:17.950
Shall we call it Xia Lin
noodle shop? Okay?

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:21.000
It doesn't need to be a big shop,
a small one is enough.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:24.620
Half year of work and
half year of rest, how wonderful!

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:27.290
Hey, wait a minute!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:31.750
My parents ask me to take so many
local products from my hometown to school.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:47.580
In our Xiang Zhuang,

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:51.830
the elders like to sprinkle the powder
of fragrant flowers on food.

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:04.790
They said the taste of fragrant flowers
could awaken people's best memories.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:26.910
It smells so good,
with a little earthy fragrance.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.120
Hey! Did you laugh at me?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.830
Give it back to me!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.790
Give it to me!

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:07.660
Lin Zhen.

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:19.000
Welcome back.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:49.120
As the saying goes, the book's meaning
reveals itself on the hundredth reading.

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:52.870
Try my copy, Bowl of the Male Dormitory!
What does it taste like?

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:58.040
If you dare to change the photo shop
into a noodle shop, I'll leave right now.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:00.910
Nobody can leave
before the debt is paid off.

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:03.040
Yo, noodles!

00:22:06.040 --> 00:22:08.950
Hey, you take one bowl away,
what about us?
